# Agent Configuration Sync

- `CLAUDE.md` is the single source of truth for project configuration and design decisions.
- When design decisions or project configuration change in `CLAUDE.md`, update the corresponding `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` files and `.github/copilot-instructions.md` in the same edit batch.
- Before finishing changes that touch agent settings, verify `.cursor/mcp.json` still includes the `svelte` server.
